---
description: Frontend testing conventions
globs: apps/web/**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Vitest / Testing Library
- Test behavior, not implementation. Query by role/text, not test ids (test ids only for charts/canvas).
- Mock the SDK via `msw` or a hand-written mock client; do NOT mock `fetch` directly.

# Playwright
- E2E specs live in `apps/web/e2e/`. One spec per user journey (auth, chart, paper-trade).
- Use storage state to skip login in unrelated specs.
- Never `waitForTimeout`; use `expect(locator).toBeVisible()` with auto-retry.
